# Complex 2 [Co(12-TMC)DMF](BF4)Cl, formula C15H35BClCoF4N5O identical to the row; tetragonal P4/nmm as the paper states for 2 (deposits 2113393 = complex 1 pyridine/BF4 salt). Paper: ab initio calculations 'based on X-ray ... geometries'. High-symmetry cell, so the cation is likely disordered across mirror planes in the CIF.; crystal formula C15 H35 B Cl Co F4 N5 O. Experimental (X-ray) structure, not optimised. Embedded reflection data omitted.
